<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Telekom to decide soon on greenshoe.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Telekom to decide soon on greenshoe.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Telekom AG and its bankers said on Sunday they would decide soon whether to grant the exercise of a so-called &quot;greenshoe&quot; option, or over-allotment by banks of 75 million extra shares .</p>
<p>&quot;We will be considering that in the next few days&quot;, an official for Deutsche Bank, one of the coordinators of the issue, said in response to a journalist question.</p>
<p>He added that the option for over-allotment could, if approved, run until the end of this year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
